id=ipados_lockscreen_tablet
name=iPadOS Lockscreen - HyperOS Tablet Edition
version=v1.1
versionCode=11
author=Spider, Antigravity
description=Transforms HyperOS lockscreen into an authentic iPadOS lockscreen and interactive customizer. Includes Apple SF Pro typography, vertical widget tray (battery, weather, calendar), dynamic color tinting, bottom photo/depth controls, and privileged system lockscreen app. Cross-compatible with HyperOS 2, 3, and 4.
